{"video_id":"jgy-003","points":[{"kp_id":"jgy-003.kp0001","video_id":"jgy-003","type":"concept_definition","statement":"痉湿暍篇：痉类急症（倪师比脑膜炎），湿为风湿，暍为中暑。","evidence_quote":"脑膜炎","start_s":22.7,"end_s":54.165,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-003.kp0002","video_id":"jgy-003","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"太阳发热无汗反恶寒为刚痉；发热汗出不恶寒为柔痉。","evidence_quote":"柔痉","start_s":133.02,"end_s":159.18,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-003.kp0003","video_id":"jgy-003","type":"formula_indication","statement":"小儿痉见项强目直等，常用葛根汤；柔痉津伤可用瓜蒌桂枝汤。","evidence_quote":"葛根汤","start_s":782.77,"end_s":931.415,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-003.kp0004","video_id":"jgy-003","type":"herb_property","statement":"麻黄中空主发汗，节部止汗，制汤宜去节取汗。","evidence_quote":"发汗","start_s":1491.26,"end_s":1508.545,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-003.kp0005","video_id":"jgy-003","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"夜尿若见麻黄汤或葛根汤证亦可选用；治症勿被病名固定。","evidence_quote":"不要被病名","start_s":1554.1,"end_s":1597.93,"confidence":0.9}]}